"nextNodeIds":[110410603,110410604]},{"nodeId":110410603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3364341346,"text":"ヒルチャールの絵を描いてたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[110410605]},{"nodeId":110410605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4137747610,"text":"けど、なんでヒルチャール？みんな似たような顔じゃないか。","nextNodeIds":[110410606]},{"nodeId":110410606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":4189669730,"text":"うーん…説明するには複雑だから、ボクの絵を直接見てみるといい。","nextNodeIds":[110410607,110410608]},{"nodeId":110410607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2555646282,"text":"これは…","nextNodeIds":[110410609]},{"nodeId":110410609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1389888954,"text":"おお、真面目に描いた作品もあれば、適当に描かれたものもあるな。","nextNodeIds":[110410610]},{"nodeId":110410610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":656028506,"text":"それらはどこにでもいるヒルチャールだ、時間をかける価値はない。","nextNodeIds":[110410611]},{"nodeId":110410611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":190621610,"text":"でもこいつを見て、体格も毛髪も姿勢も、他とは違う生命力を感じるだろう。","nextNodeIds":[110410612]},{"nodeId":110410612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":1972157538,"text":"繰り返される原始的な集団の暮らしの中で、そういった特殊性は進化を意味する。進化は無から有へ、既知から未知へ…","nextNodeIds":[110410613]},{"nodeId":110410613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":1737632850,"text":"待って、それ長くなるやつよね、私は興味ないわ。","nextNodeIds":[110410614]},{"nodeId":110410614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":2959014186,"text":"人も見つけたし、私はここで失礼するわよ。","nextNodeIds":[110410615]},{"nodeId":110410615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3903393994,"text":"あっ、こいつに聞きたいことはないのか？おーい！","nextNodeIds":[110410616]},{"nodeId":110410616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":232324146,"text":"はぁ。変わったやつだな。","nextNodeIds":[110410617]},{"nodeId":110410617,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3832202074,"text":"シスターロサリアがここまで案内してくれたようだね。うーん、礼を言いそびれてしまった。","nextNodeIds":[110410618]},{"nodeId":110410618,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3894995986,"text":"ところで、キミたちはわざわざボクを探しに来たのかい？","nextNodeIds":[110410619]},{"nodeId":110410619,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1580141858,"text":"おう、モンドでスクロースって人に会ってな、おまえの力になってほしいって言われたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[110410620]},{"nodeId":110410620,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":456148906,"text":"なるほど、彼女がキミたちを紹介したのか…","nextNodeIds":[110410621]},{"nodeId":110410621,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3690000946,"text":"では、ボクの推測が正しければ、キミが話題のあの「栄誉騎士」なんだね。","nextNodeIds":[110410622]},{"nodeId":110410622,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3606848698,"text":"龍災でのキミの働き、元素力に対する理解、それからいろいろと不思議なところも耳にしたよ…","nextNodeIds":[110410623]},{"nodeId":110410623,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":145407938,"text":"結論から話そう、可能性はひとつ——キミは「別の世界」からやってきた、そうだね？","nextNodeIds":[110410624,110410625]},{"nodeId":110410624,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3681839050,"text":"うん、そうだ。","nextNodeIds":[110410626]},{"nodeId":110410626,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3329350482,"text":"よかった。キミの協力があれば、ボクの研究も大きく進むはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[110410627,110410628]},{"nodeId":110410627,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":207187074,"text":"研究？","nextNodeIds":[110410629]},{"nodeId":110410629,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3240473698,"text":"あっ、すまない、戸惑ってるだろうね。どこから話そうか…ふむ、まずは生命の本質からにしようか？","nextNodeIds":[110410630]},{"nodeId":110410630,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":304550714,"text":"待て待て、さっそく理解できなそうな内容だぞ！","nextNodeIds":[110410631]},{"nodeId":110410631,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3698609626,"text":"うん…確かに。言葉で説明するよりも、直接見せた方がいいかもね。","nextNodeIds":[110410632]},{"nodeId":110410632,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":349625850,"text":"例えば、生命を目覚めさせ、この枯れた枝を「再生」させるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[110410634]},{"nodeId":110410634,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1886531490,"text":"そんなことできるのか！？","nextNodeIds":[110410635,110410636]},{"nodeId":110410635,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2020812930,"text":"錬金術は不思議だ。","nextNodeIds":[110410637]},{"nodeId":110410637,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":1441439202,"text":"しかし…特殊な種があるんだが、今の方法では全然効果がなくてね。","nextNodeIds":[110410639]},{"nodeId":110410639,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":1429735786,"text":"キミと同じ、それは別の世界のもので——それを咲かす方法こそ、ボクが直面している課題だ。キミに助けてほしい内容でもある。","nextNodeIds":[110410640]},{"nodeId":110410640,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2046558874,"text":"おまえができないなら、オイラたちにもどうしようもないと思うけど。","nextNodeIds":[110410641]},{"nodeId":110410641,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3262349434,"text":"いいや、ボクであっても、この世界以外の命を想像することはできない。","nextNodeIds":[110410642]},{"nodeId":110410642,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":4263306954,"text":"でも、同じ異世界から来たキミを観察すれば、いろいろとアイデアが沸いてくると思うんだ。","nextNodeIds":[110410643]},{"nodeId":110410643,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2447185026,"text":"「研究対象」にしたいってこと？","nextNodeIds":[110410644]},{"nodeId":110410644,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":33789818,"text":"#どうしよう？{NICKNAME}？なんか怪しくないか…","nextNodeIds":[110410645,110410647]},{"nodeId":110410645,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2299616890,"text":"危険性はある？","nextNodeIds":[110410646]},{"nodeId":110410646,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3265543106,"text":"まさか、キミの安全は最大限に確保するから。","nextNodeIds":[110410649]},{"nodeId":110410649,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3340632266,"text":"善は急げ、場所を変えて研究を始めようか。","nextNodeIds":[110410650]},{"nodeId":110410650,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":1779528594,"text":"","nextNodeIds":[110410651]},{"nodeId":110410651,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":924275778,"text":"アルベドと旅人、気が合うみたいね。","nextNodeIds":[110410652]},{"nodeId":110410652,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":122578330,"text":"あの二人はどちらも「異端」。モンドの平和に…影響を与えるかしら？","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":110410647,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2329968762,"text":"報酬はある？","nextNodeIds":[110410648]},{"nodeId":110410648,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":2556829402,"text":"モラ、知識、キミの知りたいこと、もしくはボクの知ってる答え、それでどうかな。","nextNodeIds":[110410649]},{"nodeId":110410636,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2270428362,"text":"錬金術は便利だ。","nextNodeIds":[110410637]},{"nodeId":110410628,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3870329682,"text":"よく分からないけど。","nextNodeIds":[110410629]},{"nodeId":110410625,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3983632858,"text":"物知りなのは本当なんだね。","nextNodeIds":[110410626]},{"nod